                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.00/2943: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Haiti</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Munro</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-04-23T11:00:00-05:00">April 23, 1931—11
                        a.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>25. Your 18, March 14, 11 a.m. Department has no objection to proposed paragraph
                    regarding commissioning of customs employees.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
